faiss/VectorTransform.cpp di marian-dev usa le intrinseche SSE3 (__m128, _mm_hadd_ps...) senza includere
<pmmintrin.h>: con il clang dell'NDK 29 su x86_64 non compila. L'include si aggiunge solo dove c'e' SSE.
Applicata da core/translate/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt alla copia dei sorgenti in core/translate/.cache; i percorsi
partono dalla root del submodule third-party/bergamot-translator, anche per i file dei suoi sottomoduli annidati.
Upstream: browsermt/marian-dev issue 113 "Missing includes for faiss when building for Android x86-64" (aperta, senza fix). browsermt/marian-dev e bergamot-translator non hanno commit dal 2024-05-12, ssplit-cpp dal 2023-08-07.
Da togliere quando: marian-dev include <pmmintrin.h> in faiss/VectorTransform.cpp, o il build non usa piu' faiss.

diff --git a/3rd_party/marian-dev/src/3rd_party/faiss/VectorTransform.cpp b/3rd_party/marian-dev/src/3rd_party/faiss/VectorTransform.cpp
--- a/3rd_party/marian-dev/src/3rd_party/faiss/VectorTransform.cpp
+++ b/3rd_party/marian-dev/src/3rd_party/faiss/VectorTransform.cpp
@@ -14,6 +14,9 @@
 #include <cstring>
 #include <memory>
 
+#ifdef __SSE__
+#include <pmmintrin.h>
+#endif
 #include <faiss/utils/random.h>
 #include "common/logging.h"
 
